[h1]English[/h1]
Bring STS1-style touchscreen controls to Slay the Spire 2. Made for Steam Deck, tablets, and touchscreen PCs, including playing on a touch device through remote desktop or game streaming.

[b]Combat[/b]
Drag cards to play, or tap a card to inspect it before choosing a target. Targeted cards stay at the lower center while aiming; untargeted cards follow your finger. Ally targets also work through the party sidebar.

[b]Fewer accidental taps[/b]
Browse card rewards and shop items, then confirm your choice with the game's own buttons. Drag to scroll supported lists, and hold supported cards to inspect them. You can still check relics, enemy intents, powers, and teammate details as usual.

[b]Enable touchscreen mode[/b]
Subscribe, restart the game, and turn on Touchscreen mode under Settings → Input. You can also turn Hold to inspect and Touch feedback on or off to suit your preferences. Settings use your selected game language. If you have BaseLib or ModConfig installed, you can change these options there too; both are optional.

You can use a controller as usual. To return to the game's original mouse controls, turn off Touchscreen mode.

For STS2 v0.111.0.

[b]Source code and feedback[/b]
[url=https://github.com/zerolfx/Touch-STS2]GitHub: Touch-STS2[/url]
[url=https://github.com/zerolfx/Touch-STS2/issues]Report a bug or suggest an improvement[/url]

[h1]中文[/h1]
为《杀戮尖塔 2》加入参考 STS1 的触屏操作，适合 Steam Deck、平板电脑和触屏电脑，也适合通过远程桌面或游戏串流在触控设备上游玩。

[b]战斗操作[/b]
拖拽卡牌即可打出，也可以先点击卡牌查看，再选择目标。需要指定目标的卡牌会在瞄准时保持在屏幕下方中央；不需要指定目标的卡牌会跟随手指移动。也可以通过队友侧栏选择友方目标。

[b]减少误触[/b]
挑选卡牌奖励或商店商品时，可以先查看，再用游戏原有的按钮确认。在支持的列表中拖动即可滚动，支持长按的卡牌可以按住查看详情。遗物、敌人意图、状态和队友信息也都可以照常查看。

[b]开启触屏模式[/b]
订阅并重启游戏后，打开“设置 → 操作设置”，开启“触屏模式”。你也可以按自己的习惯开关“长按查看”和“触点反馈”。这些选项会显示为游戏当前使用的语言。如果装了 BaseLib 或 ModConfig，也可以在它们的设置页面中调整，不需要为了使用本模组专门安装。

手柄可以照常使用。如果想恢复游戏原来的鼠标操作方式，关闭“触屏模式”即可。

适用于 STS2 v0.111.0。

